    {'key':'locale','summary':'Dictionary registry plus locale preference.','description':"Dictionary registry plus locale preference. Lookup walks the active language's declared fallback chain in the entry namespace, then repeats it in the shared common namespace before showing the key itself. Reads go through getLocale; preferences change only through setLocale, while language packs extend the catalog through addLanguage. Continuous sync uses the `locale/change` event or the LocaleFace getSnapshot/subscribe pair installed through `ctx.slots.installLocale`.",'methods':[
        方法('getLocale(): LocaleSnapshot','Read the current immutable locale snapshot.',[],'the current snapshot (stable reference until the next change).'),
        方法('getSnapshot(): LocaleSnapshot','LocaleFace getSnapshot: the current snapshot (carries `revision`; stable reference between changes, uSES-safe).',[],'the current snapshot.'),
        方法('subscribe(fn: () => void): () => void','LocaleFace subscribe: notified on every snapshot change (locale switch or dictionary registration — registrations bump the revision so already rendered outlets pick up late-arriving dictionaries and locale definitions).',[参('fn','change callback.')],'unsubscribe.'),
        方法('setLocale(id: string): void','Switch the active locale — the only user preference write entry.\n\nThe durable write happens even when the id already matches the active locale, because the active value may be a provisional browser-derived or fallback resolution that nothing has stored yet. Picking the language already on screen is still an explicit choice, and it must survive a different browser sharing the same DSH home. Only the render notification is conditional: republishing an unchanged locale would churn every subscriber for nothing.',[参('id','a registered locale id; unknown ids throw.')]),
        方法('addLanguage(input: LanguageRegistration): () => void',"Add one selectable language to the shared catalog. Its fallback must already be registered, and following fallback definitions must terminate at English. Dictionaries may register before or after this definition. Registration rechecks an unresolved Host preference and the browser's ordered language list. The caller owns the returned disposer; removing an active language falls back without clearing the stored id.",[参('input','stable id, self-described label, and fallback language id.')],'idempotent disposer removing this exact definition.',['when fields are malformed, the id is occupied, or the fallback target is unknown or creates a cycle.']),
        方法("register<N extends Extract<keyof LocaleNamespaceMap, string>>(ns: N, dicts: Record<BuiltInLocaleId, LocaleDictOf<N>>): () => void","Register a declared namespace's dictionaries, all locales in one call — the typed form: each dictionary is checked against the namespace's LocaleNamespaceMap key union (a missing or extra key is a compile error), and every shipped locale is required (bilingual balance enforced at registration). Duplicate (ns, locale) throws (single occupant; a namespace's texts have one owner). Registration bumps the revision so mounted outlets pick up late-arriving dictionaries.",[参('ns',"a namespace merged into LocaleNamespaceMap."),参('dicts','complete dictionaries keyed by built-in locale id.')],'disposer removing every locale registered by this call (idempotent).'),
        方法('register(ns: string, locale: string, dict: LocaleDict): () => void','Single-locale untyped form for language-pack contributions and namespaces outside the merge table.',[参('ns','namespace.'),参('locale','locale tag.'),参('dict','dictionary.')],'disposer (idempotent).',['when locale is not a BCP 47-style tag.']),
        方法('bind<N extends Extract<keyof LocaleNamespaceMap, string>>(ns: N): TranslateNS<N>','Bind a declared namespace to a translate function typed to its dictionary key union (plus the shared common vocabulary) — the same key domain the framework-injected `t` seat carries. The returned reference is stable per namespace (repeat binds return the same function), so it can ride inject surfaces without breaking memoization.',[参('ns','a namespace merged into LocaleNamespaceMap.')],'the typed translate function (reads the active locale at call time).'),
        方法('bind(ns: string): Translate','Untyped form for namespaces outside the merge table (dynamic composition, tests).',[参('ns','namespace.')],'the translate function.'),
    ]},
